# Onboard SE(3) parameter set for PX4 Gazebo F450 SITL.
# Values are initial tuning from the toolkit's SE(3) Offboard configuration.
# Load explicitly from the SITL MAVProxy prompt after verifying the vehicle.
# No parameters are applied by tools/sitl start.
SE3_ENABLE       1
SE3_MASS         2.0736
SE3_KX           6.0
SE3_KV           5.0
SE3_KRX          6.5
SE3_KRY          6.5
SE3_KRZ          2.8
SE3_RATE_MAX     3.0
